<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Veres Enterprises — SaaFlow</title>
<meta name="description" content="SaaFlow closes the gap between field reality and the construction schedule, automatically. PM consulting and scheduling software for Prairie contractors.">
