<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="hero-loc">Regina, Saskatchewan</span>
        <h1>Field reality and the schedule rarely agree.</h1>
        <p class="sub">SaaFlow closes the gap automatically, so Prairie construction PMs spend less time chasing updates and more time keeping projects on track.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Join early access</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Book a discovery call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-graphic" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 560 320" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <text x="0" y="18" font-family="IBM Plex Mono" font-size="11" letter-spacing="1" fill="#E8871E">AS BUILT</text>
